scope:
Covers the tree's restatement and use of GMMPS (arXiv:2604.01047 v1) Thm 4.16 and Prop. 4.10 at linstab.py:142-145, 169-180, 344-353, 450 and 1054-1055, READ at source in the v1 text layer (md5 4bac4a94...). It also covers whether the α~^S_1 = 0, γ = 0 root lies outside both results (it does, under the true hypotheses), and the audit's discrepancies (i) and (ii).

Does not cover:
- whether a v2 of the paper exists;
- a re-proof of Thm 4.16, whose decay route via Lemma A.1 of its ref. [79] is NAMED-NOT-READ;
- whether anything grows from γ = 0 at α~^S_1 = 0, which stays OPEN;
- which value of α~^S_1 is physical;
- TT existence via Thm 4.14;
- later literature, which was not searched in this pass.
